NAMES.short:
Major-radius coordinate of every point on a wall boundary outline, measured
from the machine symmetry axis in the right-handed cylindrical (R, φ, Z)
frame.

NAMES.sign:
Positive when Coulomb collisions transfer kinetic energy
from the trapped nonthermal particles to the receiving thermal ions;
negative when energy is transferred in the reverse direction.

Positive when the velocity-space integral of $\tfrac{1}{2}
m_s v_\perp^2 v^2\,\delta f_s$ is positive under the chosen eigenmode phase
convention.
